WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:04,740
Lin Xia, try the rope skills

2
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:12,380
Sister Lin Xia, you don’t usually eat like this

3
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:27,460
I bought a new one. It's dark and hard. The setting is pretty accurate.

4
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:32,270
You are my partner and you are not an outsider.

5
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:35,230
What if the gun goes off and I get hurt?

6
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:36,460
Then let me wipe it for you too

7
00:00:36,460 --> 00:01:12,250
Brother Dashan, burn me

8
00:01:12,250 --> 00:01:17,000
Beard, go into the mountains, come up

9
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:33,530
The day before yesterday I was drinking at Dali’s house

10
00:01:33,530 --> 00:01:34,530
He praises you a lot

11
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:36,530
He said that being able to marry Li Xiaoyue all depends on your advice.

12
00:01:36,530 --> 00:01:38,690
Brother Dashan, there's nothing you can do about it

13
00:01:38,690 --> 00:01:40,850
Li Xiaoyue has a wild seed in her belly

14
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:42,940
You must ask me to take over

15
00:01:42,940 --> 00:01:44,940
Brother Dali doesn't care

16
00:01:44,940 --> 00:01:47,070
I helped think of a way to get the best of both worlds.

17
00:01:47,070 --> 00:01:51,510
Beard, actually, we two brothers don’t care about that either.

18
00:01:51,510 --> 00:01:53,510
Before you show your tenderness, get your wife first

19
00:01:53,510 --> 00:01:55,510
How about she be able to give birth then?

20
00:01:55,510 --> 00:01:58,580
Beard, such a good thing happens again

21
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:00,580
You have to think about us brothers

22
00:02:00,580 --> 00:02:04,970
Sure enough it can't be Brother Tang

23
00:02:04,970 --> 00:02:07,100
A family does not speak the same language
